# Code owners for ForgeLM.
#
# When a pull request is opened, GitHub requests a review from the owner of each
# path it changes. This file only routes those review requests: whether a review
# is *required* before merging is a branch-protection setting, not anything an
# entry here can turn on. See docs/standards/code-review.md for the review
# standard and GOVERNANCE.md for how ownership is granted.
#
# These rules are evaluated last-match-wins, so a more specific pattern placed
# below `*` overrides it. When an area gets its own owner, add their line below
# the default rather than replacing it, so the default owner stays on every path
# an area owner does not name. GitHub does not request a review for a draft or a
# draft pull request.

*                       @cemililik

# Repository scaffolding and policy files stay with the default owner even after
# an area owner is added, because these paths define the rules the area owners
# work under.
/.github/               @cemililik
/CONTRIBUTING.md        @cemililik
/GOVERNANCE.md          @cemililik
/MAINTAINERS.md         @cemililik
/SECURITY.md            @cemililik
/pyproject.toml         @cemililik
